### AI-driven Smart Spaces: Privacy-Aware Multi-Agent System

#### Overview
A framework implementing secure AI-to-AI communication in physical environments through integrated sensor networks and privacy-preserving AI methodologies.

#### Technical Analysis
The Smart Spaces framework advances A2A communication through three key innovations:
1. Multi-layered sensor integration (smart meters, geophone, wireless, ultrasonic)
2. Privacy-preserving AI communication protocols with differential privacy
3. Secure inter-agent messaging system with advanced watermarking

